## Verificar servicio
```bash
systemctl status named
rndc status
```

## Configurar forwarders
`/etc/named.conf`:
```
options {
    directory '/var/named';
    forwarders {
        8.8.8.8;
        1.1.1.1;
    };
    forward first;
    allow-recursion { 10.0.0.0/8; };
    allow-query { 10.0.0.0/8; };
};
```

## Reload
```bash
rndc reload
# O:
systemctl reload named
```

## Probar
```bash
dig @localhost google.com
dig @<ip-servidor-dns> google.com
```

## Recursion deshabilitada
```
options {
    recursion no;   # ❌ evita que resuelva externos
};
```
Cambiar a `recursion yes` para servers internos que sí deben resolver externos.

## Zona interna override
Si tenés una zona `empresa.local` autoritativa, todo lo demás va por forwarders. Verificar que el `named.conf` no tenga zone glob catch-all.

## DNSSEC forward broken
Si el forwarder usa DNSSEC estricto y algún dominio falla:
```
dnssec-validation no;   # deshabilitar validación (menos seguro)
# O específico:
validate-except { 'dominio-problema.com'; };
```

## Cache lento — flush
```bash
rndc flush
rndc dumpdb -cache    # ver cache actual
```

## Logs
```
logging {
    channel default {
        file '/var/log/named.log';
        severity dynamic;
    };
    category queries { default; };
};
```

## /etc/nginx/sites-available/miapp
```nginx
upstream backend {
    server 10.10.10.11:8080 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
    server 10.10.10.12:8080 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=30s;
    keepalive 32;
}

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name mi-app.empresa.com;
    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;
}

server {
    listen 443 ssl http2;
    server_name mi-app.empresa.com;

    ssl_certificate     /etc/ssl/certs/mi-app.crt;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/private/mi-app.key;
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;

    # HSTS
    add_header Strict-Transport-Security 'max-age=63072000' always;

    # Body size (para uploads)
    client_max_body_size 100M;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://backend;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_set_header Connection '';

        # WebSocket support
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection 'upgrade';

        # Timeouts largos para WebSocket
        proxy_read_timeout 3600s;
        proxy_send_timeout 3600s;
    }

    location /static/ {
        alias /var/www/miapp/static/;
        expires 30d;
        add_header Cache-Control 'public, immutable';
    }
}
```

## Habilitar
```bash
ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/miapp /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
nginx -t
systemctl reload nginx
```

## Ver logs
```bash
tail -f /var/log/nginx/access.log
tail -f /var/log/nginx/error.log
```

## Rate limiting
```nginx
http {
    limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=mylimit:10m rate=10r/s;
}

location /api/ {
    limit_req zone=mylimit burst=20 nodelay;
    proxy_pass http://backend;
}
```

## Cache
```nginx
proxy_cache_path /var/cache/nginx keys_zone=cache:10m max_size=1g inactive=60m;

location / {
    proxy_cache cache;
    proxy_cache_valid 200 5m;
    proxy_pass http://backend;
}
```
